package <https://www.dolfin.fr/showcase/world-mythologies>:
  dolfin_version "1"
  version "1.0.0"
  author "Dolfin"
  description "World mythologies and traditions: Greek, Norse, Hindu, Japanese and Maya figures on one shared model. Several of these are living traditions; entries are descriptive, drawn from the Theogony, Prose Edda, Puranas, Kojiki and Popol Vuh."
